    "frozen_rows": 5,
    "note": "Column A holds prefilled row numbers, B3 holds the ticket-count formula over B6:B, and the Config tab sources the Priority and Ticket Classification dropdowns. The publisher locates the header dynamically within header_search; this block records what was observed and is not used to place rows."
  }
